sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Redpanda
  participant CON as OrderEventsConsumer
  participant H as CommitStockHandler
  participant R as Redis
  participant DB as inventory_db
  K->>CON: order.placed
  CON->>H: CommitStockCommand(orderId, items)
  H->>R: findByOrderId → reservation key (or "order:{orderId}" for a late commit)
  H->>R: atomic_commit.lua
  alt {4} STOCK_NOT_LOADED
    H->>DB: read counters → warm_stock.lua → retry commit once
  end
  alt {1} COMMITTED / {2} ALREADY / {3} RE-ACQUIRED
    H->>DB: hasMovement(orderId, COMMITTED)?
    H->>DB: if not: ledger COMMITTED + counters (total − q, reserved − q)
  else {0} EXPIRED_AND_OUT_OF_STOCK
    H->>K: inventory.events ← stock.reservation_failed (flow 03)
  end
  CON->>K: commit offset
